# no-ASLR RCE Evidence Record

Date: 2026-10-21
Target: PHP 8.4.26 + Apache 2.4.68 prefork + mod_php, no-ASLR worker
Constraints: Pure HTTP, no PHP written to the target webroot; the page is an ordinary echo page (historical note: the page in that run included session_start(); the chain does not depend on it and was reproduced on a pure echo page).

